# =========================================================================
# files_search — tests against THE REAL src/files_search.cyr (2.5.5)
#
# crab's M8. A real tree, a real walk, and real postings. The ranking checks name
# the order, not only the members: a search that finds the right files in the wrong
# order has failed. The postings' own invariants are checked too, because a query
# trusts them without looking.
# =========================================================================

